{"strongs": "H0288", "word": "אֲחִימֶ֫לֶךְ", "translit": "a.chi.me.lekh", "root": "אחימלך", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "brother of Melek", "definition": "אֲחִימֶ֫לֶךְ proper name, masculine ( brother of Melek , Phoenician חמלך , חמלכת ; see also אחיהו above) 1. priest in Saul's (David's) time 1Sam 21:2 (twice in verse); 1Sam 21:3 ; 1Sam 21:9 ; 1Sam 22:14 ; 1Sam 22:16 ( אֲחִימֶ֑לֶךְ 1Chr 24:31 ; Ps 52:2 = (title); son of Ahitub 1Sam 22:9 ; 1Sam 22:11 (compare12); 1Sam 22:20 father of Abiathar 1Sam 23:6 ; 1Sam 30:7 so also 2Sam 8:17 ᵑ6 Ew We Th Dr ; where ᵑ0 ׳ בןאֿביתר אחימ ; whence id. wrongly 1Chr 24:6 , compare v 1Chr 24:4 ( מִבְּנֵי אִיתָמָר ׳ אֲח ) & 1Chr 18:16 (where read ׳ אֲח for ׳ אֲב ). 2. a Hittite 1Sam 26:6 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB297')\">BDB297</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H288')\">H288</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB296')\">BDB296</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB298')\">BDB298</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֲחִימֶ֫לֶךְ</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>brother of Melek</highlight>, Phoenician <bdbheb>חמלך</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>חמלכת</bdbheb>; see also  <bdbheb><reflink>אחיהו</reflink></bdbheb> above) <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> priest in Saul's (David's) time <ref ref=\"1Sam 21:2\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(9,21,2)\">1Sam 21:2</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"1Sam 21:3\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(9,21,3)\">1Sam 21:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 21:9\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(9,21,9)\">1Sam 21:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 22:14\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(9,22,14)\">1Sam 22:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 22:16\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(9,22,16)\">1Sam 22:16</ref> (<bdbheb>אֲחִימֶ֑לֶךְ</bdbheb> <ref re